// Heart of Stone

// @0 = ~~  // #7222
@1 = ~Heart of Stone~

// @10 = ~~ // #-1
@11 = ~Heart of Stone
(Necromancy)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Heart of Stone turns the caster's own heart into a perfect, unblemished stone that alters the very nature of the wizard's body. As long as the spell is in effect, the caster is immune to petrification, gains a +4 bonus to saving throws vs. petrification, and is highly resistant to physical attacks. Piercing, missile, and slashing damage is reduced by 99%. Crushing damage is reduced by 50%. There is a 1% chance that a hit shatters the heart and kills the target unless a successful Save vs. Death is made. On a successful save the target still receives 1d8+1 points of damage and cancels the effects of the spell. The spell "Stone to Flesh" is also able to undo the magic of Heart of Stone.~

